      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A name for it such as \"Set instance as Event Mode\" might help ward off some potential backlash to the concept, by clearly marking it for special purpose. It's an idea I've had myself from roughly the day the performance ranks were first included. I'd go as far as having it allow you to select the max rank, anywhere from excellent to medium.\nIdeally it'd be part of some larger system, that'd allow other instance controls such as passing instance master status to another if needed, and allocating moderation rights to others. Also the ability to assign VIPs who would bypass the instance rank limits, so that performers or key speakers, could still make use of additional features and more complex avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-04-06T21:19:09.815Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add option to limit an instance to 'Medium' (User selectable) or above avatars.\nThis would allow for large events to take place without such a large hit from avatar performance, forcing the user base to create more well-performing avatars to take place in certain large events.\nThis could potentially weed out some of the very poorly performing avatars and give motivation for users to optimize their existing avatars.",
